OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fand night will see variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud and some clear periods. It will
OL,8,Fbe mainly dry but still with the
OL,9,Fchance of a light shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FMostly dry with variable
OL,12,Famounts of cloud and just the odd
OL,13,Flight passing shower. Light winds.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,16,Fmainly dry although rather cloudy few
OL,17,Fdays with just one or two light
OL,18,Fshowers. Light winds.
